      ],
      "role": "text",
      "text": "The official GitHub Pages workflow (see the ⁦repository's⁩ ⁦  ⁦docs/github-pages.md⁩  ⁩) builds a verified target: it resolves the Pages location from ⁦  ⁦actions/configure-pages⁩  ⁩, fails on any URL projection that disagrees with it, uploads only ⁦inventory-verified⁩ files, and retains a separate evidence artifact. Atmosphere publication uses ⁦  ⁦standard-site.json⁩  ⁩: replace the ⁦obviously-fake⁩ DID and URL before ⁦  ⁦standard-site publish⁩  ⁩. This starter page is related to ⁦[[guides/getting-started]]⁩ so the semantic graph has an edge to inspect."
    },
